KNOWNBUG dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract my_log
^\[my_log\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ variadic argument forwarded: SUCCESS$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
When checking the contract of a variadic function, the wrapper calls the
function with its declared parameters only, as a static call cannot pass on a
variable number of variadic arguments. Reading the variadic argument with
va_arg hence fails.
